          "presentation": {
            "expression": "playful",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "tease_playful_001_02",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "じゃあ言うけど、あなたはたまに作業を始める前の準備運動で一日を終わらせる。",
          "displayText": "Then I will say it: sometimes you end the whole day doing warmups before starting work.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "tease_playful_001_03",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "playful",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "tease_playful_001_03",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "でも、そこが直ったら少し寂しいかも。……いや、直して。",
          "displayText": "But if you fixed that, I might miss it a little. No, actually, fix it.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "flustered",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
