      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "tease_playful_002_01",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "軽くね。強くやると、私のほうが先に反省会を始めるから。",
          "displayText": "Lightly, then. If I go too hard, I will start reflecting before you do.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "tease_playful_002_02",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "playful",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "tease_playful_002_02",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "あなた、やる気を探すために別の作業を増やす癖があるよね。",
          "displayText": "You have a habit of creating extra work while looking for motivation.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "tease_playful_002_03",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "playful",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "tease_playful_002_03",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "でも、気持ちは分かる。整った入口って、ちょっと甘い罠だから。",
          "displayText": "But I understand. A tidy entrance is a sweet little trap.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "tease_playful_002_04",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "thinking",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "tease_playful_002_04",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "さ、笑ったなら始めよう。笑ってないなら、なおさら始めよう。",
          "displayText": "Now, if you laughed, start. If you did not laugh, start even more.",
